pt across the dark waters, not just warning ships away from danger, but honoring those lost below. He would preserve the letter, ensure their memory endured.", "w02": "凌晨四点的城市陷入深沉的寂静。街道空荡荡的，只有路灯投下的黄晕光影。高楼大厦如同巨人沉睡，窗户都暗了下去。偶尔一辆出租车驶过，打破短暂的宁静。清洁工人在马路边工作，扫帚沙沙的声音显得特别清晰。天空还未泛起鱼肚白，星星已经褪去光芒。这个时刻属于城市的另一面——没有喧嚣，没有匆忙，只有最真实的宁静。", "w03": "• A function is like a recipe: you give it ingredients (inputs), and it makes something (output), then gives it back to you.\n• Recursion is when a recipe tells you to follow itself again with different ingredients—like Russian nesting dolls, each one opening to find a smaller one inside.\n• Eventually you reach the smallest doll that doesn't open anymore (the base case), and then all the dolls close back up in order."}
